{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-river-island-one-shoulder-scuba-dress-white-crepe-skort-and-white-crepe-top-2607-0084","content_id":"df32c291-2346-4161-89a4-a64c4758556c","description":"Product Recall for River Island One Shoulder Scuba Dress, White Crepe Skort and White Crepe Top presenting a serious chemical risk.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"d84d9818-ed19-41b4-b9b2-f46cc6b18939","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-07-10T10:29:14+01:00","id":"d84d9818-ed19-41b4-b9b2-f46cc6b18939","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-07-10T10:29:14+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a50bb6ac3d64d94cacab751/2607-0084-product-recall-river-island-childrenswear.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: River Island One Shoulder Scuba Dress, White Crepe Skort and White Crepe Top</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious chemical risk as the attached brooch contains an excess concentration of cadmium.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by River Island.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Clothing, textiles and fashion items - Clothing Adornment/Floral Accessories/Badges/Buckles</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>River Island</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Unknown</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>One shoulder scuba dress in pink and blue, white crepe skort and white crepe top with bow/heart-shaped brooch details. All childrenswear sizes are affected.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_d84d9818-ed19-41b4-b9b2-f46cc6b18939\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a50bb6ac3d64d94cacab751/2607-0084-product-recall-river-island-childrenswear.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"affected-products\">Affected Products</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Name</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product Number</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>One Shoulder Scuba Dress – Blue</td>\n      <td>438395</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>One Shoulder Scuba Dress - Pink</td>\n      <td>438394</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>White Crepe Skort</td>\n      <td>438200</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>White Crepe Top</td>\n      <td>438202</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The products present a serious chemical risk as the casings of the heart- and bow-shaped brooches contain an excess of cadmium.</p>\n\n<p>Further information on the health effects of cadmium exposure can be accessed on GOV.UK here: <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/cadmium-properties-incident-management-and-toxicology\">https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/cadmium-properties-incident-management-and-toxicology</a></p>\n\n<p>The products do not meet the requirements of the REACH Regulations 2008.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been recalled from end users by River Island.</p>\n\n<p>We recommend that you stop using the products immediately and return them to River Island for a full refund. For more information on returning the items, please access: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.riverisland.com/product-recall\">https://www.riverisland.com/product-recall</a> or contact River Island via <a href=\"mailto:customer.services@river-island.com\">customer.services@river-island.com</a>, phone: +44 (0) 3445766444.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2607-0084, 2607-0093, 2607-0095, 2607-0097</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-10T09:30:44Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"affected-products","level":3,"text":"Affected Products"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"clothing-textiles-fashion","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-07-10","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-07-10T10:30:44+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-river-island-one-shoulder-scuba-dress-white-crepe-skort-and-white-crepe-top-2607-0084","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-river-island-one-shoulder-scuba-dress-white-crepe-skort-and-white-crepe-top-2607-0084","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-river-island-one-shoulder-scuba-dress-white-crepe-skort-and-white-crepe-top-2607-0084","content_id":"df32c291-2346-4161-89a4-a64c4758556c","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-10T09:30:44Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: River Island One Shoulder Scuba Dress, White Crepe Skort and White Crepe Top (2607-0084)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-river-island-one-shoulder-scuba-dress-white-crepe-skort-and-white-crepe-to